  "summary": "Rehearse bounded fleet cohorts with package/state fingerprints, compatibility and trial outcomes; fix unconfirmed-stage overwrite, attempt-budget reset and rollback-version checks.",
  "rationale": "Shows rollout readiness and recovery consequences before touching devices, while enforcing the underlying lifecycle invariants.",
  "limitations": [
    "Directory-only simulation with a public demo key, not real hardware secure boot or an operational rollout.",
    "Trial outcomes are supplied assumptions, not measured or predicted device health.",
    "The OS/operator is trusted; external concurrent writers are not locked by the rehearsal workflow."
